cale":"en"},"130":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-128","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#4-verify-thinruntime","content":"In ThinRuntime mode, `config-parse.py` reads the Fluid runtime JSON and writes:","locale":"en"},"131":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-129","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#4-verify-thinruntime","content":"The generated mount script starts `curvine-fuse` with the target path provided by Fluid.","locale":"en"},"132":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-130","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#the-image-starts-in-the-wrong-mode","content":"Check the pod environment and command:","locale":"en"},"133":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-131","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#the-image-starts-in-the-wrong-mode","content":"The main inputs are:","locale":"en"},"134":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-132","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#the-image-starts-in-the-wrong-mode","content":"`FLUID_RUNTIME_TYPE`","locale":"en"},"135":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-133","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#the-image-starts-in-the-wrong-mode","content":"`FLUID_RUNTIME_COMPONENT_TYPE`","locale":"en"},"136":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-134","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#the-image-starts-in-the-wrong-mode","content":"`FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`","locale":"en"},"137":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-135","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#the-image-starts-in-the-wrong-mode","content":"container arguments such as `master`, `worker`, `client`, or `fluid-thin-runtime`","locale":"en"},"138":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-136","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-pods-cannot-generate-curvine-config","content":"Check whether the runtime config exists:","locale":"en"},"139":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-137","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-pods-cannot-generate-curvine-config","content":"`generate_config.py` needs valid Fluid runtime JSON. If the file is empty, missing, or malformed, the Curvine TOML file will not be generated correctly.","locale":"en"},"140":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-138","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#mountufs-fails","content":"Check the master pod logs and the Dataset mount options:","locale":"en"},"141":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-139","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#mountufs-fails","content":"For object storage, make sure endpoint, access key, secret key, region, and path-style options are correct. Secrets referenced by Fluid must be mounted into the pod before `mountUfs.sh` reads them.","locale":"en"},"142":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-140","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#fuse-mount-is-missing","content":"Check the client or ThinRuntime pod:","locale":"en"},"143":{"id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-141","page_id":"/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags