le-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#3-test-tools-and-scripts","content":"Data migration tool: `rclone`, using multi-threaded transfer to ensure migration efficiency and stability.","locale":"en"},"565":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-18","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#3-test-tools-and-scripts","content":"Object storage service: MinIO, deployed on a single machine to simulate an S3-compatible object storage scenario.","locale":"en"},"566":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-19","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-test-plan","content":"This test focuses on two core Curvine mount modes, `fs-mode` and `cache-mode`. It verifies the impact of cold-start reads, Page Cache hit reads, and metadata cache optimization on performance. Native MinIO is used as the baseline for comparison to comprehensively evaluate Curvine small-file read capability.","locale":"en"},"567":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-20","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#1-fs-mode-test-procedure","content":"Mount Curvine to the specified directory:","locale":"en"},"568":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-21","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#1-fs-mode-test-procedure","content":"Data migration: use `rclone` to copy 70,000 images from the local `/data/img/bdd` directory to the Curvine mount directory. In fs-mode, copying 70,000 images to the Curvine mount directory with `rclone` took 55 seconds in total. The transfer efficiency was stable and met the requirements of fast large-scale small-file ingestion.","locale":"en"},"569":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-22","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#1-fs-mode-test-procedure","content":"Data read test command:","locale":"en"},"570":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-23","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#1-fs-mode-test-procedure","content":"Metadata cache optimization test: enable kernel metadata cache, client metadata cache, and dual cache separately.","locale":"en"},"571":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-24","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-test-procedure","content":"First use the `mc` command to pre-copy 70,000 images to the corresponding MinIO bucket, `xuen/cache_mode`.","locale":"en"},"572":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-25","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-test-procedure","content":"Mount Curvine to the specified directory:","locale":"en"},"573":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-26","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-test-procedure","content":"Read test command:","locale":"en"},"574":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-27","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#2-cache-mode-test-procedure","content":"Metadata cache optimization test: enable kernel metadata cache, client metadata cache, and dual cache separately.","locale":"en"},"575":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-28","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#4-test-results","content":"| Test Type                         | Processing Speed (images/second) | Performance Improvement Compared with MinIO Cold Read |\n| --------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Native MinIO cold read (baseline) | 1675                             | -                                                     |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"576":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-29","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#4-test-results","content":"| Test Type             | Processing Speed (images/second) | Performance Improvement Compared with MinIO Cold Read |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Curvine basic version | 5615                             | +235.2%                                               |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"577":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-30","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#4-test-results","content":"| Test Type                       | Processing Speed (images/second) | Performance Improvement Compared with MinIO Cold Read |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Curvine + kernel metadata cache | 5997                             | +257.9%                                               |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"578":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-31","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#4-test-results","content":"| Test Type                       | Processing Speed (images/second) | Performance Improvement Compared with MinIO Cold Read |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Curvine + client metadata cache | 6174                             | +268.6%                                               |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"579":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-32","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#4-test-results","content":"| Test Type                     | Processing Speed (images/second) | Performance Improvement Compared with MinIO Cold Read |\n| ----------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| Curvine + dual metadata cache | 6117                             | +265.2%                                               |","locale":"en","table":"table-0"},"580":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-33","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#5-test-conclusion","content":"Far beyond native storage: Curvine's optimal read performance reached 6174 images/second, which is 3.68 times that of native MinIO at 1675 images/second. The basic version reached 5615 images/second, which is already 3.35 times that of native MinIO.","locale":"en"},"581":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-34","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#5-test-conclusion","content":"Significant metadata cache gains: after metadata cache was enabled, performance improved by 6.8% to 10.0% compared with the Curvine basic version, and the client metadata cache delivered the best optimization effect.","locale":"en"},"582":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-35","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#5-test-conclusion","content":"Efficient metadata mechanism: the native Curvine basic version already achieved high-performance reads of 5615 images/second. It can meet AI small-file read requirements without relying on cache, reducing configuration complexity and O&M costs.","locale":"en"},"583":{"id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read-36","page_id":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Benchmark/small-file-read#5-test-conclusion",