ine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-233","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#worker","content":"`[worker.spdk_disk]` is only meaningful in server builds that enable SPDK (`build.sh --spdk` or `--spdk-rdma`). It contains `enabled`, `app_name`, `reactor_mask`, `qpair_acquire_timeout`, and a `targets` array (`trtype`, `adrfam`, `traddr`, `trsvcid`, `subnqn`).","locale":"en"},"1153":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-234","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#client","content":"| Field          | Default | Meaning                                |\n| -------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `master_addrs` | `[]`    | Master RPC addresses; derived if empty |","locale":"en","table":"table-7"},"1154":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-235","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#client","content":"| Field      | Default     | Meaning                                                                     |\n| ---------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | Client hostname; overridden by `net_interface` or `CURVINE_CLIENT_HOSTNAME` |","locale":"en","table":"table-7"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-236","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#client","content":"| Field        | Default | Meaning                |\n| ------------ | ------- | ---------------------- |\n| `io_threads` | `16`    | Cli