`node_cache_size` were removed. Use `meta_cache_timeout` and `node_cache_timeout` instead.","locale":"en"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-335","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`negative_timeout = 0` disables negative-lookup caching; it does not mean \"cache forever\".","locale":"en"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-336","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`direct_io` and `write_back_cache` cannot both be enabled; startup rejects the combination.","locale":"en"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-337","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`fuse_opts` supports the VFS pairs `ro`/`rw`, `nodev`/`dev`, `nosuid`/`suid`, `noexec`/`exec`, `noatime`/`atime`, `sync`/`async`, plus `dirsync`, `allow_other`, `default_permissions`, and `big_write`. The legacy libfuse options `auto_unmount`, `allow_root`, and `max_write` are not supported by the direct mount backend.","locale":"en"},"1257":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-338","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"Duration values accept strings (`\"1s\"`, `\"500ms\"`, `\"1h\"`) or bare integers interpreted as milliseconds. The older `*_ms` keys remain aliases.","locale":"en"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-339","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`curvine-web` is a standalone process (binary `curvine-web`, started with `bin/curvine-web.sh start`). It serves the admin console — overview, file browser, worker list, configuration and monitoring dashboards. It is not started by `curvine-server` and is not part of the local cluster helper script; start it explicitly when you need the UI.","locale":"en"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-340","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| Field      | Default     | Meaning                             |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | Bind hostname for the admin console |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-341","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| Field  | Default | Meaning                        |\n| ------ | ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `port` | `9000`  | HTTP port of the admin console |","locale":"en","table":"table-9"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-342","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`[master].web_port` (`9010`) is a metrics-only listener. Visiting it in a browser returns Prometheus text output, not the admin UI. Use `[web].port` (`9000`) for the UI.","locale":"en"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-343","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"The admin console embeds its own collector and time-series store, so dashboards work without Prometheus. Switch `mode` to `prometheus` or `auto` to query an existing Prometheus server instead.","locale":"en"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-344","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                        |\n| --------- | ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `enabled` | `true`  | Enable the observability stack |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-345","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field  | Default   | Meaning                            |\n| ------ | --------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `mode` | `builtin` | `builtin`, `prometheus`, or `auto` |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-346","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field             | Default | Meaning                                   |\n| ----------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `scrape_interval` | `60s`   | Scrape interval of the built-in collector |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-347","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field            | Default | Meaning                   |\n| ---------------- | ------- | ------------------------- |\n| `scrape_timeout` | `3s`    | Per-target scrape timeout |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-348","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field       | Default | Meaning                    |\n| ----------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `retention` | `24h`   | In-memory retention window |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-349","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field                    | Default | Meaning                 |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `max_concurrent_scrapes` | `32`    | Concurrent scrape limit |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1269":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-350","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field                              | Default | Meaning                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `max_concurrent_dashboard_queries` | `8`     | Concurrent range queries per dashboard refresh |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-351","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field        | Default  | Meaning                |\n| ------------ | -------- | ---------------------- |\n| `max_series` | `100000` | Series cardinality cap |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1271":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-352","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| Field                    | Default | Meaning                     |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | --------------------------- |\n| `max_samples_per_series` | `10000` | Samples retained per series |","locale":"en","table":"table-10"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-353","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"FUSE metrics scraping is opt-in. With `enabled = true` and empty `targets`, the collector scrapes `127.0.0.1:{fuse.web_port}`.","locale":"en"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-354","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                       |\n| --------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `enabled` | `false` | Discover and scrape FUSE `/metrics` endpoints |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1274":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-355","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityfuse","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                             |\n| --------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `targets` | `[]`    | `host:port` or full `http://host:port/metrics` URLs |","locale":"en","table":"table-11"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-356","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| Field | Default | Meaning                                                   |\n| ----- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `url` | empty   | Prometheus base URL, for example `http://prometheus:9090` |","locale":"en","table":"table-12"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-357","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning                           |\n| --------------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `query_timeout` | `5s`    | Timeout for Prometheus query APIs |","locale":"en","table":"table-12"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-358","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservabilityprometheus","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                                                                                |\n| ------------------ | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fallback_builtin` | `true`  | With `mode = \"auto\"`, fall back to the built-in collector when Prometheus is unhealthy |","locale":"en","table":"t