:"table-13"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-363","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field    | Default     | Meaning                                                           |\n| -------- | ----------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `region` | `us-east-1` | Region reported by `GetBucketLocation` and used for SigV4 scoping |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-364","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field          | Default             | Meaning                                                    |\n| -------------- | ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `put_temp_dir` | `/tmp/curvine-temp` | Temporary directory for PUT staging (multipart and simple) |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-365","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                         | Default   | Meaning                                                                            |\n| ----------------------------- | --------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `put_memory_buffer_threshold` | `1048576` | Size below which a PUT is buffered in memory instead of spilling to `put_temp_dir` |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-366","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                   | Default    | Meaning                       |\n| ----------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `put_max_memory_buffer` | `16777216` | Maximum in-memory buffer size |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-367","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                       | Default | Meaning                                                                           |\n| --------------------------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `access_key` / `secret_key` | empty   | Static credentials when the gateway does not use the distributed credential store |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-368","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                     | Default | Meaning                                              |\n| ------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `enable_distributed_auth` | `false` | Load credentials from Curvine instead of static keys |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-369","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                                  |\n| -------