ws-chunked` records over 16 MiB are buffered until their signature is verified; use a private directory |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-373","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field                          | Default                | Meaning                                                                                                                                               |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `signed_chunk_spool_max_bytes` | `10GB` (`10737418240`) | Spool budget per gateway process; a record that cannot reserve its full size gets `503 SlowDown`. Keep at least 5 GiB so any legal single record fits |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1293":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-374","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"| Field      | Default | Meaning                            |\n| ---------- | ------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `web_port` | `9003`  | Gateway health / metrics HTTP port |","locale":"en","table":"table-13"},"1294":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-375","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` (default `false`) selects where multipart staging lives: `false` keeps upload parts on the gateway host's local filesystem, `true` uses Curvine DFS so several gateway instances can serve the same upload.","locale":"en"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-376","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#s3_gateway","content":"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` is read by the gateway process, not by the Worker. You can set it in the gateway's own config file; it does not require restarting Workers.","locale":"en"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-377","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"The top-level `[log]` section is shared by the Rust client and FUSE. Each service also has its own nested `log` table (`master.log`, `worker.log`, `mds.log`, `transfer.log`) and the CLI has `[cli].log`.","locale":"en"},"1297":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-378","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field   | Default | Meaning   |\n| ------- | ------- | --------- |\n| `level` | `INFO`  | Log level |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-379","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field     | Default  | Meaning                                             |\n| --------- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `log_dir` | `stdout` | `stdout`, `stderr`, or a directory for file logging |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-380","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field       | Default | Meaning                                   |\n| ----------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `file_name` | empty   | Base log file name; empty means `curvine` |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-381","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning               |\n| --------------- | ------- | --------------------- |\n| `max_log_files` | `10`    | Rotated files to keep |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-382","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                                                |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `max_file_size_mb` | `100`   | Size-based rotation threshold; `0` means no size limit |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1302":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-383","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `time_rotation` | empty   | `daily` or `hourly`; empty means no time-based rotation |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1303":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-384","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field            | Default | Meaning                    |\n| ---------------- | ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `display_thread` | `false` | Include thread name and ID |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-385","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                 |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ----------------------- |\n| `display_position` | `true`  | Include source location |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-386","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                                     |\n| --------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `targets` | `[]`    | Split named log targets into separate files |","locale":"en","table":"table-14"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-387","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#global-log","content":"Rotation only applies when `log_dir` is a directory. With size and time rotation both unset, files rotate by size at 100 MB. If `max_file_size_mb = 0` and no valid `time_rotation` is configured, files rotate daily so they cannot grow without limit.","locale":"en"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-388","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#cli","content":"`CliConf` contains only `log`. The default CLI log level is `warn`, with output to stdout.","locale":"en"},"1308":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-389","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"`[job]` configures the legacy Master-side job implementation used by clients with `transfer.enabled = false`. Transfer jobs use `[transfer]` for ownership, recovery, and retention.","locale":"en"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-390","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field          | Default | Meaning             |\n| -------------- | ------- | ------------------- |\n| `job_life_ttl` | `24h`   | Job record lifetime |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-391","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field             | Default | Meaning                           |\n| ----------------- | ------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `job_cleanup_ttl` | `10m`   | Cleanup interval for expired jobs |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-392","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                |