ploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                                 | Default | Meaning                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `master_max_pending_load_job_submits` | `4096`  | Pending submit requests before admission |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-397","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                             | Default | Meaning                                    |\n| --------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `master_load_job_runtime_threads` | `4`     | Runtime threads reserved for load planning |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-398","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                              | Default | Meaning                                     |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| `master_load_job_blocking_threads` | `16`    | Blocking threads reserved for load planning |","locale":"en","table":"table-15"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-399","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#job","content":"| Field                                   | Default | Meaning                                                  |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------- 