loy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-420","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field                    | Default  | Meaning                        |\n| ------------------------ | -------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `max_tasks_per_transfer` | `100000` | Maximum tasks per transfer job |","locale":"en","table":"table-16"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-421","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field                              | Default | Meaning                                   |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `ufs_max_concurrency_per_endpoint` | `32`    | Maximum concurrent tasks per UFS endpoint |","locale":"en","table":"table-16"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-422","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning              |\n| ------------------ | ------- | -------------------- |\n| `task_max_retries` | `3`     | Maximum task retries |","locale":"en","table":"table-16"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-423","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field           | Default | Meaning                                                                    |\n| --------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `lease_timeout` | `120s`  | Ownership lease duration used for recovery and multi-instance coordination |","locale":"en","table":"table-16"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-424","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field                | Default | Meaning                                                   |\n| -------------------- | ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `terminal_retention` | `168h`  | Retention for completed, failed, and canceled job records |","locale":"en","table":"table-16"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-425","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"| Field | Default        | Meaning             |\n| ----- | -------------- | ------------------- |\n| `log` | `transfer.log` | Transfer log config |","locale":"en","table":"table-16"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-426","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"Do not use the deprecated inputs `store_type`, `sqlite_path`, or `mysql_url` in new configurations. `store_url` selects the backend from its scheme. Internal queue, probe, and scheduler values are not part of the supported user configuration surface.","locale":"en"},"1346":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-427","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#transfer","content":"For PostgreSQL with a private CA, append `sslrootcert=/path/to/ca.pem` to the `store_url`; TLS validates the system trust store by default.","locale":"en"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-428","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"Service discovery is disabled by default. When enabled, the only supported provider is etcd.","locale":"en"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-429","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning               |\n| --------- | ------- | --------------------- |\n| `enabled` | `false` | Enable etcd discovery |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-430","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field      | Default | Meaning                                         |\n| ---------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `provider` | `etcd`  | Discovery provider; must be `etcd` when enabled |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-431","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field       | Default | Meaning                                              |\n| ----------- | ------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `endpoints` | `[]`    | etcd endpoints, for example `[\"http://etcd-0:2379\"]` |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-432","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field    | Default    | Meaning                  |\n| -------- | ---------- | ------------------------ |\n| `prefix` | `/curvine` | Absolute etcd key prefix |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-433","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field                | Default | Meaning              |\n| -------------------- | ------- | -------------------- |\n| `connect_timeout_ms` | `3000`  | etcd connect timeout |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-434","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field                | Default | Meaning              |\n| -------------------- | ------- | -------------------- |\n| `request_timeout_ms` | `3000`  | etcd request timeout |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-435","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field                    | Default | Meaning                             |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `watch_reconnect_min_ms` | `1000`  | Watch reconnect backoff lower bound |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-436","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field                    | Default | Meaning                             |\n| ------------------------ | ------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `watch_reconnect_max_ms` | `30000` | Watch reconnect backoff upper bound |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-437","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field                          | Default | Meaning                                    |\n| ------------------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `watch_reconnect_jitter_ratio` | `0.2`   | Watch reconnect jitter ratio (`0.0`–`1.0`) |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-438","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"| Field               | Default | Meaning                                            |\n| ------------------- | ------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `allow_stale_cache` | `true`  | Return stale cache while the watch is disconnected |","locale":"en","table":"table-17"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-439","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#discovery","content":"When discovery is enabled, `cluster_id` must contain only lowercase letters, digits, `_`, and `-`. Effective keys are `{prefix}/{cluster_id}/services/{kind}/{service_id}`.","locale":"en"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-440","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fault_injection","content":"Test-only fault control plane. It is disabled by default and must not be enabled in normal deployments.","locale":"en"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-441","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fault_injection","content":"| Field     | Default | Meaning                  |\n| --------- | ------- | ------------------------ |\n| `enabled` | `false` | Expose fault HTTP routes |","locale":"en","table":"table-18"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-442","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fault_injection","content":"| Field            | Default               | Meaning                                       |\n| ---------------- | --------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `auth_token_env` | `CURVINE_FAULT_TOKEN` | Environment variable holding the bearer token |","locale":"en","table":"table-18"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-443","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fault_injection","content":"The HTTP routes require binaries built with the `fault-injection` Cargo feature (for example `curvine-server/fault-injection`). Enabling `[fault_injection]` without that feature fails server startup instead of silently omitting the route.","locale":"en"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-444","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#version-compatibility-policy","content":"`[master.compatibility]` and `[worker.compatibility]` share the same fields:","locale":"en"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-445","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#version-compatibility-policy","content":"| Field  | Default    | Meaning                                                                 |\n| ------ | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `mode` | `diagnose` | `diagnose` logs incompatibilities; `enforce` rejects incompatible peers |","locale":"en","table":"table-19"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-446","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#version-compatibility-policy","content":"| Field                | Default | Meaning                                                             |\n| -------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `min_worker_version` | empty   | Lowest Worker release accepted by the Master (empty = not enforced) |","locale":"en","table":"table-19"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-447","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#version-compatibility-policy","content":"| Field                | Default | Meaning                                               |\n| -------------------- | ------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `min_client_version` | empty   | Lowest client release accepted (empty = not enforced) |","locale":"en","table":"table-19"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-448","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#version-compatibility-policy","content":"| Field              | Default | Meaning                              |\n| ------------------ | ------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `blocked_versions` | `[]`    | Versions rejected regardless of mode |","locale":"en","table":"table-19"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-449","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#version-compatibility-policy","content":"The protocol version range is a code-level contract, not an operator setting. Invalid mode strings and unparseable version bounds degrade to the lenient default instead of failing closed.","locale":"en"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-450","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#version-compatibility-policy","content":"`enforce` mode requires Workers that report `component_info` on their heartbeat. Workers older than the release that introduced this field resolve to `MissingInfo` and are rejected, so keep `diagnose` until the whole Worker fleet has been upgraded.","locale":"en"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode","type":"page","content":"Distributed Mode","breadcrumbs":["Documents","Deploy","Deploy Curvine Cluster","Distributed Mode"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode","locale":"en"}