ne-Cluster/Preparation/compile-18","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#local-compilation","content":"More make targets: run `make` or `make help`. Summary:","locale":"en"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-19","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#local-compilation","content":"**Environment:** `make check-env` — Check build dependencies (also run automatically by `make build`).","locale":"en"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-20","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#local-compilation","content":"**Building:** `make build` / `make all` — Build; output in `build/dist`. `make dist` — Build and create tar.gz in project root. `make dist-only` — Package existing `build/dist` only.","locale":"en"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-21","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#local-compilation","content":"**Partial builds:** `make build ARGS='-p core'` (server+client+cli), `make build ARGS='-p core -p fuse'`, `make build ARGS='-p web'`, `make build ARGS='-d'` (debug). Use `make build-hdfs` for HDFS support (native + WebHDFS); `make build ARGS='--skip-java-sdk'` to skip Java SDK.","locale":"en"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-22","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#local-compilation","content":"**Docker:** `make docker-build` — Build **runtime** image from source. `make docker-build-compile` — Build compilation image (interactive). `make docker-compile` — Compile in container, output to local `build/dist`.","locale":"en"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-23","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#local-compilation","content":"**CSI:** `make curvine-csi` — Build curvine-csi Docker image.","locale":"en"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-24","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#local-compilation","content":"**Example:** `RELEASE_VERSION=v1.0.0 make dist` — Build and package with a version tag.","locale":"en"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-25","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#docker-compilation","content":"If your system environment is macOS or Windows, or your Linux version is not in the supported list, we recommend using Docker compilation. This allows you to operate safely in an isolated environment without affecting your system environment.","locale":"en"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-26","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#1-using-curvine-provided-compilation-images","content":"Curvine provides compilation images on Docker Hub: `curvine/curvine-compile:latest` (and optionally `curvine/curvine-compile:build-cached` with cached dependencies).","locale":"en"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-27","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#1-using-curvine-provided-compilation-images","content":"Use the compile image as a sandbox: run compilation (and optionally execution) inside the container, with the repo mounted at `/workspace`.","locale":"en"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-28","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#1-using-curvine-provided-compilation-images","content":"**Option A — Compile in container, output to local `build/dist`:**","locale":"en"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-29","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#1-using-curvine-provided-compilation-images","content":"(Uses image `curvine/curvine-compile:build-cached`; result appears in `build/dist`.)","locale":"en"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-30","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#1-using-curvine-provided-compilation-images","content":"**Option B — Persistent development container:**","locale":"en"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-31","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"If you cannot use the official images (e.g. network restrictions), build the compilation image locally from the Dockerfiles in `curvine-docker/compile`.","locale":"en"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-32","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"Available Dockerfiles under `curvine-docker/compile/`:","locale":"en"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-33","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"**Dockerfile_rocky9** — Rocky Linux 9 (recommended baseline)","locale":"en"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-34","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"**Dockerfile_rocky9_cached** — Rocky 9 with dependency cache (faster rebuilds)","locale":"en"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-35","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"**Dockerfile_ubuntu22** — Ubuntu 22.04","locale":"en"},"1572":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-36","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"**Dockerfile_ubuntu24** — Ubuntu 24.04","locale":"en"},"1573":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-37","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"**Dockerfile_amzn2** — Amazon Linux 2","locale":"en"},"1574":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-38","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"From the **project root**:","locale":"en"},"1575":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-39","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"Compiled output is in `build/dist` inside the container (and on the host if you mounted the repo).","locale":"en"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-40","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"If there are significant differences between your compilation image's OS version and the host machine's OS version, or they are not from the same distribution, the Docker-compiled artifacts may not run directly on the host machine due to libc or ABI incompatibilities.","locale":"en"},"1577":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-41","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#2-advanced-build-your-own-compilation-image","content":"Therefore, for Docker-compiled artifacts, we strongly recommend running them on the same OS version or within Docker containers!","locale":"en"},"1578":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-42","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"Curvine supports multiple storage backends including OSS, HDFS, S3, MinIO, and more. By default, these are integrated via OpenDAL. Curvine also provides optimized implementations for OSS and HDFS. Select backends with `--ufs` when building:","locale":"en"},"1579":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-43","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"Supported parameters:","locale":"en"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-44","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"| Parameter  | Description                       |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------- |\n| opendal-s3 | Use OpenDAL for S3 object storage |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1581":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-45","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"| Parameter   | Description                        |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| opendal-oss | Use OpenDAL for OSS object storage |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1582":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-46","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"| Parameter   | Description                          |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| opendal-gcs | Use OpenDAL for Google Cloud Storage |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1583":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-47","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"| Parameter      | Description                |\n| -------------- | -------------------------- |\n| opendal-azblob | Use OpenDAL for Azure Blob |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1584":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-48","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"| Parameter       | Description         |\n| --------------- | ------------------- |\n| opendal-webhdfs | Use OpenDAL WebHDFS |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1585":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-49","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"| Parameter    | Description                               |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------- |\n| opendal-hdfs | Use the native HDFS client (includes JNI) |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1586":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-50","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"| Parameter | Description                             |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| oss-hdfs  | Use JindoSDK for Alibaba Cloud OSS-HDFS |","locale":"en","table":"table-1"},"1587":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-51","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"When compiling the `oss-hdfs` module, you need to set JindoSDK environment variables:","locale":"en"},"1588":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-52","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"To compile multiple UFS modules simultaneously, specify `--ufs` multiple times, e.g. `make build ARGS='--ufs oss-hdfs --ufs opendal-oss'`.","locale":"en"},"1589":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile-53","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/compile#ufs-module-support","content":"Note that both OSS accelerated buckets and standard object storage buckets use the `oss://test-bucket` format. When mounting OSS storage, you need to specify the appropriate module. For detailed mount usage, see the CLI mount section.","locale":"en"},"1590":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","type":"page","content":"Deployment Preparation","breadcrumbs":["Documents","Deploy","Deploy Curvine Cluster","Preparation"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","locale":"en"},"1591":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-0","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#supported-runtime-baseline","content":"Supported Runtime Baseline","locale":"en"},"1592":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-1","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#resource-requirements","content":"Resource Requirements","locale":"en"},"1593":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-2","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#create-installation-package","content":"Create Installation Package","locale":"en"},"1594":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-3","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#environment-script-and-main-config","content":"Environment Script and Main Config","locale":"en"},"1595":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-4","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","content":"This chapter covers the practical preparation needed before deploying Curvine from a release package or from a locally built `build/dist`.","locale":"en"},"1596":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-5","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#supported-runtime-baseline","content":"The current `main` branch and release workflow are Linux-first. The officially documented tested distributions are:","locale":"en"},"1597":{"id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup-6","page_id":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Preparation/deployment-setup#supported-runtime-baseline","content":"| Operating System | Kernel Requirement | Tested Version | Dependencies |\n| ---------------- | ------------------ | -------------- | -