ture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"| 角色       | Kubernetes 工作负载 | 作用                  |\n| -------- | --------------- | ------------------- |\n| `client` | `DaemonSet`     | 面向业务 Pod 的 FUSE 挂载。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"3699":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-63","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"这个 class 还定义了 `executionEntries.mountUFS`。Fluid 会调用这个入口，让 Curvine 在服务 Dataset 前先挂载底层 UFS 路径。Curvine 镜像中的脚本路径是：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3700":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-64","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"该脚本会读取 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`，对非 Curvine 原生路径执行 `cv mount`，对 `curvine://` 原生路径直接跳过并返回路径。最后输出 Fluid 需要的 JSON：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3701":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-65","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"这个 class 还定义了 `executionEntries.ReportSummary`。Fluid 会在 master Pod 中调用这个入口，把缓存状态刷新到 Dataset Status。Curvine 镜像中的脚本路径是：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3702":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-66","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"该脚本会执行：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3703":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-67","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"它只向 stdout 输出严格 JSON，格式遵循 Fluid 的 ReportSummary 输出要求：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3704":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-68","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-创建-cacheruntimeclass","content":"Curvine 只上报 master 能低成本返回的值：已缓存字节数、缓存容量和文件数。`ufsTotal`、`cachedPercentage`、`cacheHitRatio` 暂时保持为 `0`，直到 Curvine 有权威的 UFS 总量和命中率元数据。这样可以避免把“缓存容量使用率”误写成“Dataset 缓存百分比”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3705":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-69","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"从这个文件开始：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3706":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"应用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3707":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"示例文件同时包含两个资源：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3708":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataset-和-cacheruntime","content":"`Dataset.spec.mounts[].mountPoint` 是 Curvine 通过 Fluid 暴露的后端路径。业务 Pod 后续挂载的是 Dataset 生成的 PVC，不需要直接挂这个后端路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3709":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#3-等待运行时就绪","content":"检查 Fluid 资源和 Curvine Pod：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3710":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#3-等待运行时就绪","content":"如果 Dataset 没有 ready，查看 Dataset 和 Curvine Pod 日志：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3711":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#4-运行测试-pod","content":"使用示例工作负载：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3712":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#4-运行测试-pod","content":"应用并查看日志：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3713":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#4-运行测试-pod","content":"这个 Pod 会挂载由 Curvine 支撑的 Fluid PVC，并做简单读写检查。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3714":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"CacheRuntime Pod 不使用固定手写的 TOML 文件。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3715":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"Fluid 会把运行时信息写入下面这个环境变量指向的文件：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3716":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"Curvine 随后运行：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3717":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-81","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"该脚本读取 Fluid JSON，并写出：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3718":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-82","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"几个关键生成项如下：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3719":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-83","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"| Curvine 配置   | 来源                                |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `cluster_id` | Dataset 名称或 Dataset mount option。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3720":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-84","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"| Curvine 配置              | 来源                                  |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `journal.journal_addrs` | Fluid master topology 和 service 名称。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3721":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-85","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"| Curvine 配置        | 来源                                    |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `worker.data_dir` | worker options 或 Fluid `tieredStore`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3722":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-86","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"| Curvine 配置            | 来源                       |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `client.master_addrs` | 生成的 master RPC endpoint。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3723":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-87","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"| Curvine 配置      | 来源                        |\n| --------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `fuse.mnt_path` | Fluid client target path。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-3"},"3724":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-88","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-配置如何生成","content":"所以，`FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH` 对 master、worker、client Pod 都很关键。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3725":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-89","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"`DataLoad` 用来把 Dataset 中的一个或多个路径预热到缓存里。对 Curvine 来说，DataLoad Job 最终应执行类似命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3726":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-90","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"这里要分清两件事：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3727":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-91","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"`CacheRuntimeClass.dataOperationSpecs` 定义“这个缓存运行时如何执行 DataLoad”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3728":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-92","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#cacheruntime-dataload","content":"`DataLoad` 资源定义“要给哪个 Dataset 预热哪些路径”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3729":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-93","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"在已有 `CacheRuntimeClass` 顶层增加 `dataOperationSpecs`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3730":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-94","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"只需要增加这个字段。不要为了打开 DataLoad 去改 `topology`、`fileSystemType` 或 master/worker/client 定义。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3731":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-95","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"不要把这段直接当成完整生产命令复制使用，除非你的 DataLoad 镜像或脚本会在执行 `cv load` 前生成 `/etc/curvine.toml`。Curvine 示例 `curvine-docker/fluid/cache-runtime/curvine-cache-runtime-class.yaml` 已经包含这部分逻辑。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3732":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-96","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"Fluid 会把这些环境变量注入 DataLoad Job：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3733":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-97","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                      | 含义       |\n| ------------------------- | -------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_METADATA` | 是否加载元数据。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3734":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-98","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                       | 含义                   |\n| -------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_DATA_PATH` | 要加载的路径，多个路径用 `:` 连接。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3735":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-99","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"| 环境变量                           | 含义                    |\n| ------------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `FLUID_DATALOAD_PATH_REPLICAS` | 每个路径的副本数，多个值用 `:` 连接。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"3736":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-100","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"Curvine 的 CacheRuntimeClass 示例会在 `dataOperationSpecs` 里内联 DataLoad 脚本，因为 Fluid 会把数据操作作为短生命周期 Job 执行。脚本会先从 Fluid runtime JSON 生成 Curvine 配置；如果这个文件没有挂载，再依次回退到 Dataset 元数据、Pod label，以及 `<dataset>-load` 这类 DataLoad 名称规则。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3737":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-101","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#1-在-cacheruntimeclass-中打开-dataload","content":"当 Fluid 传入 `/minio` 这样的 Dataset 内路径时，脚本会读取 Curvine mount 元数据，把它解析成真正需要加载的 Curvine source，再执行 `cv load --watch`。这样 DataLoad 和 `mountUFS` 的语义是一致的。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3738":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-102","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3739":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-103","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"应用：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3740":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-104","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#2-创建-dataload-资源","content":"`spec.dataset` 指定 Dataset。`spec.target[].path` 指定要预热的 Dataset 内路径。Fluid 会把这些路径通过 `FLUID_DATALOAD_DATA_PATH` 传给 Job。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3741":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-105","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#3-检查-dataload-job","content":"只有每个目标路径的 `cv load --watch` 都成功退出，DataLoad 才算成功。如果 `cv load --watch` 返回错误，Job 应该失败，这样 Fluid 才能把问题暴露出来。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3742":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-106","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"Fluid chart `helm-chart-fluid-1.1.0-alpha.10` 会把 runtime config 文件挂载进 CacheRuntime DataLoad Pod，并设置 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`。使用这个版本时，Curvine DataLoad 可以像 master、worker、client Pod 一样生成配置。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3743":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-107","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"更旧的 Fluid 版本或自定义 DataLoad 模板，可能只设置了 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`，但没有把 runtime config 文件挂载进 DataLoad Pod。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3744":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-108","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"如果你的 DataLoad 命令需要读取 runtime JSON，请同时确认两件事：","locale":"zh-cn"},"3745":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-109","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration#关于-etcfluidconfigruntimejson","content":"DataLoad Pod 中设置了 `FLUID_RUNTIME_CONFIG_PATH`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"3746":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration-110","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/fluid-integration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Architecture/flu