ploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"说明：","locale":"zh-cn"},"4885":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-333","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`meta_cache_capacity` 与 `node_cache_size` 已被移除，请改用 `meta_cache_timeout` 与 `node_cache_timeout`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4886":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-334","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`negative_timeout = 0` 表示关闭负查找缓存，而不是“永久缓存”。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4887":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-335","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`direct_io` 与 `write_back_cache` 不能同时启用，启动时会被拒绝。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4888":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-336","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"`fuse_opts` 支持 VFS 选项对 `ro`/`rw`、`nodev`/`dev`、`nosuid`/`suid`、`noexec`/`exec`、`noatime`/`atime`、`sync`/`async`，以及 `dirsync`、`allow_other`、`default_permissions`、`big_write`。旧版 libfuse 选项 `auto_unmount`、`allow_root`、`max_write` 不受直接挂载后端支持。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4889":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-337","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#fuse","content":"时长值支持字符串（`\"1s\"`、`\"500ms\"`、`\"1h\"`）或按毫秒解释的裸整数。旧的 `*_ms` 键仍作为别名接受。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4890":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-338","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`curvine-web` 是一个独立进程（二进制 `curvine-web`，通过 `bin/curvine-web.sh start` 启动），提供管理控制台：集群总览、文件浏览、Worker 列表、配置与监控大盘。它不由 `curvine-server` 启动，也不在本地集群辅助脚本的启动列表中；需要 UI 时请单独启动。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4891":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-339","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| 字段         | 默认值         | 含义         |\n| ---------- | ----------- | ---------- |\n| `hostname` | `localhost` | 管理控制台监听主机名 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"4892":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-340","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"| 字段     | 默认值    | 含义            |\n| ------ | ------ | ------------- |\n| `port` | `9000` | 管理控制台 HTTP 端口 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"4893":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-341","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#web","content":"`[master].web_port`（`9010`）只是一个指标监听端口，用浏览器打开它只会得到 Prometheus 文本输出，不是管理界面。UI 请访问 `[web].port`（`9000`）。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4894":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-342","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"管理控制台内嵌了自己的采集器和时序库，因此不依赖 Prometheus 也能看大盘。把 `mode` 改成 `prometheus` 或 `auto` 可改为查询已有的 Prometheus。","locale":"zh-cn"},"4895":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-343","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段        | 默认值    | 含义         |\n| --------- | ------ | ---------- |\n| `enabled` | `true` | 是否启用可观测性组件 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4896":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-344","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段     | 默认值       | 含义                              |\n| ------ | --------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `mode` | `builtin` | `builtin`、`prometheus` 或 `auto` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4897":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-345","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段                | 默认值   | 含义         |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ---------- |\n| `scrape_interval` | `60s` | 内置采集器的抓取间隔 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4898":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf-346","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/conf#webobservability","content":"| 字段               | 默认值  | 含义      |\n| ---------------- | ---- | ------- |\n| `scrape_timeout` | `3s` | 单目标抓取超时 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"4899":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Di