------------- |\n| Deployment `curvine-transfer` | Load / Export 服务，仅在启用时创建 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5041":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#架构说明","content":"| 资源                         | 说明                                |\n| -------------------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| Service `curvine-transfer` | 集群内 Transfer RPC 与 Web 端点，仅在启用时创建 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-0"},"5042":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#架构说明","content":"默认 `openKruise.enabled=false`，StatefulSet 使用 `apps/v1`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5043":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#transfer-服务","content":"Transfer 是用于独立调度 Load 和 Export 的可选服务。仅当 `transfer.enabled=true` 时，Chart 才会创建 `curvine-transfer` Deployment 和 Service；在此之前，Master 提供旧的 Load API。启用 Transfer 不需要修改 Master 或 Worker 配置。若要在 Chart 之外部署 Transfer，参见\nKubernetes 部署 Transfer。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5044":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"使用包含 Transfer 二进制的 Curvine 镜像版本；不要只因 Chart 支持以下参数就使用较旧的镜像 tag。高可用或多副本部署时，必须先保证 MySQL 可达，再启动 Transfer Pod：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5045":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"Chart 会创建仅集群内可见的 `curvine-transfer` `ClusterIP` Service，并将其 FQDN 写入 `[transfer].hostname`。Curvine 根据该 hostname 和 `transfer.rpcPort` 自动推导 RPC 地址；常规 Helm 部署不要配置 `endpoints`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5046":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"`transfer.storeUrl` 为空时使用单 Pod SQLite 默认值。Chart 会为其数据目录创建 `ReadWriteOnce` PVC，且不设置 `storageClassName`，因此 Kubernetes 自动使用默认 StorageClass；Pod 被替换后数据仍会保留。`transfer.replicas > 1` 时 MySQL 是必需的，高可用部署也建议使用 MySQL。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5047":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"SQLite 模式下，Transfer Deployment 使用 `Recreate`，使旧 Pod 在新 Pod 启动前释放 `ReadWriteOnce` 卷。Helm 卸载时会保留 SQLite PVC；只有明确丢弃 Transfer 元数据时才手动删除它。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5048":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Deploy/Deploy-Curvine-Cluster/Distributed-Mode/k8s-Deployment#启用-transfer","content":"生成的 ConfigMap 同时供 Master、Worker 和 Transfer 使用。集群外 CLI 主机也必须使用 `[transfer] enabled = true` 的集群配置；客户端命令仍是 `cv load`、`cv export`、`cv load-status` 和 `cv cancel-load`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"