tecture","content":"本章节将深入介绍 Curvine 的技术架构，详细剖析其各层组件的功能、交互方式以及设计理念，帮助你全面了解 Curvine 系统的工作原理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5626":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-4","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"Curvine 采用分层设计的分布式架构，各组件职责明确，具备良好的可扩展性和高可用性。整个架构主要分为三层：**控制层**（Master）、**存储层**（Worker）、**接入层**（客户端：FUSE、SDK、CLI），共同完成数据的存储、处理和管理。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5627":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-5","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"Curvine 由三个主要服务器端角色加上客户端和 UFS 组成：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5628":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-6","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**Curvine 客户端**：数据读写操作由客户端实现，通过 RPC 调用 Curvine 服务器端接口（从 Master 获取元数据，从 Worker 获取块数据）。客户端支持多种访问方式：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5629":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-7","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**FUSE 挂载**：通过 libfuse/3 的 POSIX 兼容挂载 (curvine-fuse)","locale":"zh-cn"},"5630":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-8","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**HDFS & SDK**：Java / Python / libsdk 接口","locale":"zh-cn"},"5631":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-9","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**CSI 驱动**：Kubernetes 卷驱动 (curvine-csi)","locale":"zh-cn"},"5632":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-10","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**CLI (`cv`)**：文件系统操作、报告和集群管理的管理工具","locale":"zh-cn"},"5633":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-11","page