/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**MasterFilesystem**：文件系统操作（mkdir、create、rename、delete、list）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5642":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**FsDir + InodeStore**：内存中的 inode 树和元数据管理","locale":"zh-cn"},"5643":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**JournalSystem**：编辑日志和快照以进行恢复","locale":"zh-cn"},"5644":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**Worker / Mount Manager**：Worker 心跳和 UFS 挂载管理","locale":"zh-cn"},"5645":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**Quota / Job / Replication**：配额控制、TTL、驱逐、复制调度","locale":"zh-cn"},"5646":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-24","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**RocksDB Metadata Store**：持久元数据存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"5647":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-25","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**Raft Consensus**：Leader 选举和日志复制","locale":"zh-cn"},"5648":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-26","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture#整体架构概述","content":"**Worker**：存储块数据并服务块读写 RPC；通过心跳向 Master 上报。不保存文件系统元数据。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5649":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture-27","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/Overview/architecture","tags":[],"type"