User-Manuals/Access/fuse#前置条件","content":"**Curvine 集群**已启动（已启动 Master 与 Worker）。参见 裸机部署 或 快速开始。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5819":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-12","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#前置条件","content":"**配置**：运行 FUSE 的节点需能访问集群配置文件（如 `conf/curvine-cluster.toml`），且 Master 地址正确。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5820":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-13","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#前置条件","content":"**系统支持**：支持 FUSE2 与 FUSE3，不同发行版行为可能略有差异。详见 支持的 Linux 发行版。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5821":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"在安装目录下执行（如 `build/dist` 或解压后的发布包）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"5822":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"**默认挂载路径**：`/curvine-fuse`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5823":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"**默认配置**：`conf/curvine-cluster.toml`（相对于启动进程时的当前工作目录）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5824":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#启动-fuse","content":"使用 `bin/curvine-fuse.sh stop` 停止，`bin/curvine-fuse.sh restart` 重启。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5825":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/fuse#使用挂载点","content":"在 FUSE 挂载路径下可使用常规 Linux 文件命令：`ls`、`cat`、`rm`、`mv`、`mkdir`、`du`、`cp` 等。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5826":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/Us