ale":"zh-cn"},"5893":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-39","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","content":"Curvine S3 网关通过 S3 兼容的 HTTP API 暴露 Curvine 集群。已经支持 S3 协议的工具——AWS CLI、MinIO Client、boto3 或任意 S3 SDK——无需 FUSE 或 Curvine 原生客户端即可读写 Curvine 路径。网关使用 AWS Signature V2/V4 对每个请求进行认证，并将 bucket 和 key 映射为 Curvine 文件系统操作。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5894":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-40","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","content":"网关是一个可选的独立服务，不由 `curvine-server` 启动，但**已经包含在默认构建和发行包中**：`build.sh` 的默认 `--package all` 会构建 `curvine-s3-gateway`，发行包中也会带上 `bin/curvine-s3-gateway.sh`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5895":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#概述","content":"S3 请求进入网关后，先通过凭据存储完成认证，再经由 Curvine 客户端执行。对象数据以流式方式在网关与 Curvine Worker 之间传输，不会将整个对象缓存在内存中。","locale":"zh-cn"},"5896":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"S3 兼容的 bucket 和对象 API（见 支持的 S3 操作）","locale":"zh-cn"},"5897":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"使用 AWS Signature V2/V4 认证，支持本地或 Curvine 托管的凭据存储","locale":"zh-cn"},"5898":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway#主要特性","content":"支持 HTTP Range 请求，返回 `206 Partial Content`","locale":"zh-cn"},"5899":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Access/s3-gateway-45","page_