i","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"通过 `cargo run -p curvine-cli -- ...` 运行时，帮助中的程序名会显示为 `curvine-cli`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6630":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-41","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#原生-clicv","content":"本文中的 `<PATH>`、`<JOB_ID>` 等为位置参数；`[OPTION]` 表示可选项。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6631":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-42","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"**用法：** `cv report [json|all|capacity|used|available]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6632":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-43","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令          | 说明                                                 |\n| ----------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv report` | 默认概览，包含 active master、容量、inode/block 数和 worker 列表。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6633":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-44","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令               | 说明                        |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `cv report json` | 以 JSON 输出完整 `MasterInfo`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6634":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-45","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#1-report查看集群状态","content":"| 命令                                   | 说明                  |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------- |\n| `cv report all --show-workers false` | 文本概览，可关闭 worker 明细。 |","locale":"zh-cn",