ATH> [-n\\|--no-clobber]` | 上传本地文件到 Curvine；`-n` 不覆盖已存在的目标。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6659":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-70","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                              | 说明                |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `cv fs get <PATH> <LOCAL_PATH>` | 下载 Curvine 文件到本地。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6660":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-71","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                           | 说明              |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------- |\n| `cv fs cat <PATH> [--offset N] [--length N]` | 输出文件内容，可指定字节范围。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6661":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-72","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                  | 说明                 |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `cv fs tail <PATH> [-n\\|--bytes N]` | 输出文件末尾的字节，默认 1024。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6662":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-73","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                   | 说明           |\n| -------------------- | ------------ |\n| `cv fs touch <PATH>` | 创建空文件或更新时间戳。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6663":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-74","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                                                         | 说明                                                                                                   |\n| -------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs rm <PATH> [-r\\|--recursive] [--skip-trash] [--async] [-f\\|--force]` | 删除文件或目录。`--skip-trash` 绕过回收站（如已启用）直接永久删除；`--async` 立即返回，由 Master 在后台回收（仅限 Curvine 路径）；`-f` 忽略不存在的路径。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6664":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-75","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令               | 说明         |\n| ---------------- | ---------- |\n| `cv fs trash ls` | 列出回收站中的条目。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6665":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-76","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                                                              | 说明                                                             |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs trash restore <TRASH_PATH> [--dst <PATH>] [--overwrite]` | 将回收站条目（如 `/.Trash/1700000000000-42`）恢复到原位置，或恢复到 `--dst` 指定的路径。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6666":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-77","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                           | 说明                                             |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv fs trash empty [--wait]` | 永久删除回收站中的所有条目；`--wait` 等待 Master 回收完毕并输出回收的大小。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6667":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-78","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                           | 说明                         |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `cv fs stat <PATH> [--json]` | 查看路径状态；`--json` 以 JSON 输出。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6668":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-79","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                   | 说明              |\n| -------------------- | --------------- |\n| `cv fs count <PATH>` | 统计目录下文件 / 目录数量。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6669":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-80","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                               | 说明      |\n| -------------------------------- | ------- |\n| `cv fs mv <SRC_PATH> <DST_PATH>` | 移动或重命名。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6670":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-81","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令                          | 说明        |\n| --------------------------- | --------- |\n| `cv fs du <PATH> [-h] [-v]` | 查看目录空间占用。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6671":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-82","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#3-fs文件系统操作","content":"| 命令              | 说明                  |\n| --------------- | ------------------- |\n| `cv fs df [-h]` | 查看文件系统容量 / 已用 / 可用。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-4"},"6672":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-83","p