------------------------- | -------- |\n| `oss-hdfs` | 使用 JindoSDK / OSS-HDFS 语义。 | `oss://` |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6711":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-122","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"| 取值        | 说明             | 常见协议                                                                    |\n| --------- | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `opendal` | 使用 OpenDAL 后端。 | `s3://`、`oss://`、`hdfs://`、`webhdfs://`、`cos://`、`gcs://`、`azblob://` 等 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-7"},"6712":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-123","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"当前实现还有几个容易遗漏的行为：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6713":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-124","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"对 `s3://...` 路径，如果没有显式传 `s3.bucket_name`，CLI 会自动从 URI 提取并补全。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6714":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-125","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"对 `hdfs://...` 路径，如果没有显式传 `hdfs.namenode` / `hdfs.root`，CLI 会自动从 URI 推导。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6715":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-126","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"如果配置里出现 `hdfs.kerberos.*`，但既没有 `hdfs.kerberos.ccache`，环境里也没有 `KRB5CCNAME`，CLI 会打印 Kerberos ticket cache 警告。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6716":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-127","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"`validate_path_and_configs` 当前只对 S3 路径做额外格式校验；其它 scheme 主要依赖后续 provider 初始化和连通性检查。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6717":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-128","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6718":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-129","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"各 UFS 类型（S3、OSS、HDFS、WebHDFS）的常见参数列表见文末 附录：UFS 挂载参数。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6719":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-130","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"默认开启 `--check-path-consist=true`。因此像 `s3://bucket/datasets` 这样的 UFS 路径，通常需要挂载到 `/bucket/datasets`。如果确实需要不一致映射，请显式传 `--check-path-consist=false`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6720":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-131","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#4-mount将-ufs-挂载到-curvine","content":"当前源码里首次创建 `fs_mode` 挂载时会自动触发一次 `resync`。手动 `cv mount resync ...` 只适用于 `fs_mode` 挂载点。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6721":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-132","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#5-umount卸载挂载点","content":"**用法：** `cv umount <CURVINE_PATH>`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6722":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-133","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#5-umount卸载挂载点","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6723":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-134","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"**用法：** `cv load [OPTIONS] <SOURCE_PATH> [TARGET_PATH]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6724":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-135","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数         | 说明                                 |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `<SOURCE_PATH>` | UFS 源 URI，或已有 mount 下的 Curvine 路径。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-8"},"6725":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-136","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数         | 说明                             |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `[TARGET_PATH]` | 可选 Curvine 目标路径。已挂载源路径会自动推导目标。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-8"},"6726":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-137","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数       | 说明             |\n| ------------- | -------------- |\n| `-w, --watch` | 提交后立即持续观察任务状态。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-8"},"6727":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-138","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数          | 说明               |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- |\n| `--no-overwrite` | 目标已经存在时失败，不覆盖目标。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-8"},"6728":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-139","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6729":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-140","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#6-load提交-load-任务","content":"启用 Transfer 后，`load` 会提交 Transfer Job；否则使用旧 Master Job 路径。两种模式\n下命令都会输出 Job ID 和目标路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6730":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-141","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#transfer-路由","content":"启用独立 Transfer 后，命令行不变：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6731":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-142","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#transfer-路由","content":"| 客户端配置                        | `cv load` / `cv export` 路由   |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `[transfer] enabled = false` | 为兼容已有集群，调用旧 Master Load API。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"6732":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-143","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#transfer-路由","content":"| 客户端配置                       | `cv load` / `cv export` 路由 |\n| --------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `[transfer] enabled = true` | CLI 直接调用 Transfer 服务 RPC。  |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-9"},"6733":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-144","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#transfer-路由","content":"Transfer 服务和客户端都需要配置 Transfer。按客户端切换时无需修改 Master 和 Worker\n配置；`transfer.enabled = false` 的客户端会继续调用旧 Master API。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6734":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-145","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"**用法：** `cv export [OPTIONS] <PATH>`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6735":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-146","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"`<PATH>` 必须是一个挂载路径下的 Curvine 路径。Curvine 会根据挂载自动推导 UFS 目标路径。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6736":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-147","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"| 选项 / 参数  | 说明                |\n| -------- | ----------------- |\n| `<PATH>` | 要导出的 Curvine 源路径。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"6737":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-148","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"| 选项 / 参数       | 说明             |\n| ------------- | -------------- |\n| `-w, --watch` | 提交后立即持续观察任务状态。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"6738":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-149","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"| 选项 / 参数          | 说明            |\n| ---------------- | ------------- |\n| `--no-overwrite` | UFS 目标已存在时失败。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-10"},"6739":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-150","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#7-export将-curvine-路径导出到-ufs","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6740":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-151","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#8-load-status查询加载任务状态","content":"**用法：** `cv load-status [OPTIONS] <JOB_ID>`","loc