认就会进入轮询模式，默认刷新间隔为 `5s`；源码暂未暴露“只查询一次然后退出”的独立开关。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6747":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-158","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#9-cancel-load取消加载任务","content":"**用法：** `cv cancel-load [OPTIONS] <JOB_ID>`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6748":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-159","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#9-cancel-load取消加载任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数    | 说明         |\n| ---------- | ---------- |\n| `<JOB_ID>` | 要取消的任务 ID。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"6749":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-160","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#9-cancel-load取消加载任务","content":"| 选项 / 参数         | 说明                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------ |\n| `--conf <PATH>` | 可选的单次配置覆盖；日常使用不需要。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-12"},"6750":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-161","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#9-cancel-load取消加载任务","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6751":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-162","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"**用法：** `cv load-list [OPTIONS]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6752":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-163","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数                | 说明                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------ |\n| `--path <PREFIX>` | 匹配源或目标路径以该前缀开头的任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6753":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-164","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数                  | 说明                               |\n| ------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `--mount <CV_PATH>` | 匹配某个 Curvine 挂载点下的 `fs_mode` 任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6754":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-165","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数                | 说明                                                         |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `--state <STATE>` | 按状态过滤：`pending`、`loading`、`completed`、`failed`、`canceled`。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6755":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-166","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数               | 说明                       |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `--running-only` | 只显示 pending/loading 的任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6756":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-167","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数              | 说明                         |\n| --------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `--failed-only` | 只看失败任务；配合 `-v` 时只打印失败的任务行。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6757":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-168","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数            | 说明                 |\n| ------------- | ------------------ |\n| `--limit <N>` | 返回的任务数上限（默认 `50`）。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6758":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-169","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数             | 说明                        |\n| -------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `--offset <N>` | 分页偏移，按最近优先跳过 N 条（默认 `0`）。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6759":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-170","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数              | 说明            |\n| --------------- | ------------- |\n| `-v, --verbose` | 输出每个任务的任务级明细。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6760":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-171","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#10-load-list列出最近的-load--export-任务","content":"| 参数                          | 说明                            |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `--include-finished <BOOL>` | 是否包含已完成/失败/已取消的任务（默认 `true`）。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-13"},"6761":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-172","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"`cv transfer` 仅在 `[transfer] enabled = true` 时可用。它用于列举、查看、重试和分页查询 Transfer 任务；日常提交仍使用 `cv load` 或 `cv export`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6762":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-173","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"该命令要求客户端配置可访问的 Transfer endpoint。服务部署见\nTransfer 服务。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6763":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-174","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                 | 说明                                                                    |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv transfer list` | 列出任务。可使用 `--kind load\\|export`、`--state`、`--tenant`、`--submitter` 过滤。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6764":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-175","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                            | 说明                                                          |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `cv transfer status <JOB_ID>` | 查看单个任务。使用 `--verbose` 查看任务明细，或用 `--watch --interval 1s` 轮询。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6765":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-176","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                           | 说明               |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `cv transfer tasks <JOB_ID>` | 查看单个任务的 task 分页。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6766":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-177","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                            | 说明                |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `cv transfer cancel <JOB_ID>` | 取消一个 Transfer 任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6767":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-178","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                           | 说明                     |\n| ---------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `cv transfer retry <JOB_ID>` | 将失败、取消或部分成功任务重试为一个新任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6768":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-179","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"| 命令                    | 说明             |\n| --------------------- | -------------- |\n| `cv transfer tenants` | 按 tenant 汇总任务。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-14"},"6769":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-180","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6770":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-181","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#11-transfer运维-transfer-任务","content":"`load-status` 与 `cancel-load` 仍保留为兼容命令。启用 Transfer 时它们调用 Transfer；关闭时调用旧 Master 实现。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6771":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-182","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#12-version查看版本","content":"**用法：** `cv version`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6772":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-183","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#12-version查看版本","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6773":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-184","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#12-version查看版本","content":"当前实现会输出 `curvine-cli <version>`，并带上 commit / branch 信息。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6774":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-185","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#12-version查看版本","content":"所有二进制还支持全局 `--version-json` 参数，以 JSON 形式输出完整结构化版本\n（组件名、发布版本、git 来源、协议版本、能力）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6775":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-186","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#13-bench内置基准测试","content":"**用法：** `cv bench [OPTIONS]`、`cv bench prefill [OPTIONS]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6776":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-187","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#13-bench内置基准测试","content":"`bench` 可对 `cv://` 路径（client 模式）或 `file://` 路径（FUSE 模式）运行元数据与吞吐量测试套件。`cv bench prefill` 用于为混合负载预置可复用的工作集。常用参数包括 `--path`、`--profile basic|deep`、`--mode auto|client|fuse`、`-p/--threads`、`--workload`、`--block-size`、`--big-file-size` 和 `--big-file-count`。完整参数请运行 `cv bench --help`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6777":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-188","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#14-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"**用法：** `cv fsck <PATH> [OPTIONS]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6778":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-189","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#14-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"| 参数       | 说明         |\n| -------- | ---------- |\n| `<PATH>` | 要检查的文件或目录。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-15"},"6779":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-190","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#14-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"| 参数         | 说明                |\n| ---------- | ----------------- |\n| `--detail` | 对目录输出每个文件与块的详细信息。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-15"},"6780":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-191","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#14-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"| 参数                     | 说明                                      |\n| ---------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `--list-page-size <N>` | 每次列目录 RPC 返回的条目数（默认 `256`，范围 `1-4096`）。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-15"},"6781":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-192","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#14-fsck块副本健康检查","content":"`fsck` 会将每个块记录的副本与当前可用副本进行对比，报告副本不足的块和读取错误。扫描发现问题时会输出告警行。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6782":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-193","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#15-admin-config查看与覆盖-master-运行时配置","content":"**用法：** `cv admin config <set|get|reset> ...`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6783":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-194","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#15-admin-config查看与覆盖-master-运行时配置","content":"运行时覆盖只作用于正在运行的 Master，不需要改配置文件，而且**不持久**：Master 重启后会恢复为配置文件里的值。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6784":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-195","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#15-admin-config查看与覆盖-master-运行时配置","content":"| 命令                    | 说明                               |\n| --------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `cv admin config get` | 列出所有已注册的运行时配置键，以及它们的文件值、覆盖值和生效值。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-16"},"6785":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-196","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#15-admin-config查看与覆盖-master-运行时配置","content":"| 命令                          | 说明     |\n| --------------------------- | ------ |\n| `cv admin config get <KEY>` | 查看单个键。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-16"},"6786":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-197","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#15-admin-config查看与覆盖-master-运行时配置","content":"| 命令                                  | 说明                   |\n| ----------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `cv admin config set <KEY> <VALUE>` | 设置内存覆盖，并打印覆盖前与生效后的值。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-16"},"6787":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-198","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#15-admin-config查看与覆盖-master-运行时配置","content":"| 命令                            | 说明               |\n| ----------------------------- | ---------------- |\n| `cv admin config reset <KEY>` | 清除覆盖，回落到配置文件中的值。 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-16"},"6788":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-199","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#15-admin-config查看与覆盖-master-运行时配置","content":"当前版本中 Master **没有注册任何**运行时可调整的键（`build_master_runtime_registry` 返回空注册表）。因此 `cv admin config get` 会输出 `(no runtime config entries)`，`set` / `reset` 会返回 `unsupported runtime configuration ...; writable: []`。命令入口是为后续可注册的键预留的；现阶段需要修改参数请改配置文件并重启。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6789":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-200","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#16-snapshot创建-master-元数据快照","content":"**用法：** `cv snapshot create [--force]`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6790":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-201","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#16-snapshot创建-master-元数据快照","content":"请求活跃 Master 立即创建元数据快照，并输出快照目录和 checkpoint 耗时。日志截断和 checkpoint 保留在后台异步完成。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6791":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-202","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#16-snapshot创建-master-元数据快照","content":"距上一次快照不足 `journal.snapshot_min_interval` 时请求会被拒绝；`--force` 仍然执行 checkpoint，执行期间元数据写入会暂停。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6792":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-203","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#16-snapshot创建-master-元数据快照","content":"checkpoint 在 Master 上执行，无法取消。命名空间很大时，耗时可能超过 `client.rpc_timeout_ms`（默认 120s），即使快照成功，重试也会报告 `a leader snapshot is already in progress`。请先在 `--conf` 指定的配置文件中调大 `client.rpc_timeout_ms`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6793":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-204","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#17-completionshell-补全脚本","content":"**用法：** `cv completion <SHELL>`","locale":"zh-cn"},"6794":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-205","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#17-completionshell-补全脚本","content":"输出 `bash`、`zsh`、`fish`、`powershell` 或 `elvish` 的补全脚本。例如在当前 bash 会话中启用补全：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6795":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-206","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"发行包里的 `bin/dfs` 是一个兼容包装器：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6796":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-207","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"当第一个子命令是 `fs` 或 `report` 时，它会调用 Java `io.curvine.CurvineShell`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6797":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-208","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"`dfs fs` 保留 Hadoop `FsShell` 风格，因此子命令写法是 `-ls`、`-mkdir`、`-rm -r` 这种单短横线形式。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6798":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-209","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"其它子命令最终仍会转发到 Rust `curvine-cli`，但日常运维建议直接使用 `cv`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6799":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-210","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6800":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-211","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"其中 `dfs report info` 对应 Java 兼容入口的完整文本概览；语义上接近 `cv report all`，但命令名并不相同。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6801":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-212","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#兼容-clidfs","content":"如果你需要 HDFS Shell 兼容语义或依赖 Hadoop 配置文件（如 `core-site.xml` / `hdfs-site.xml`），使用 `dfs` 更合适；如果你需要 Curvine 当前源码里的完整命令集，优先使用 `cv`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6802":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-213","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli#posix--fuse","content":"Curvine 提供 FUSE 文件系统接口。挂载后（例如通过 `bin/curvine-fuse.sh start`），可以在挂载点直接使用标准 Linux 命令：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6803":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/cli-214","page_id"