在 Linux 上，每个服务还会额外暴露标准的 Prometheus 进程采集指标（`process_resident_memory_bytes`、`process_cpu_seconds_total`、`process_open_fds`、`process_threads`）。内存和 CPU 告警请用这些指标；旧的 `used_memory_bytes` 和 `rocksdb_used_memory_bytes` 已不存在。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6863":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#兼容性指标","content":"master 会对每个 worker 心跳和客户端握手执行兼容性评估，并将结果暴露为指标\n（详见版本管理与兼容性）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6864":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#兼容性指标","content":"| 指标名称                  | 类型    | 标签                    | 描述                    |\n| --------------------- | ----- | --------------------- | --------------------- |\n| compat_worker_verdict | Gauge | `worker_id`、`verdict` | 每个 worker 当前兼容性结论，为 1 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6865":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#兼容性指标","content":"| 指标名称                  | 类型    | 标签                      | 描述                    |\n| --------------------- | ----- | ----------------------- | --------------------- |\n| compat_client_verdict | Gauge | `client_addr`、`verdict` | 每个 client 当前兼容性结论，为 1 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6866":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#兼容性指标","content":"| 指标名称                          | 类型      | 标签                    | 描述                |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | --------------------- | ----------------- |\n| compat_enforce_rejected_total | Counter | `component`、`verdict` | enforce 模式下累计拒绝次数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-1"},"6867":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#兼容性指标","content":"`verdict` 标签取值：`compatible`、`missing_info`、`blocked`、\n`protocol_mismatch`、`version_too_old`、`version_unknown`。建议对\n`compat_worker_verdict` / `compat_client_verdict` 中非 `compatible` 的结论设置告警，\n以发现混合版本集群；对 `compat_enforce_rejected_total` 的增长设置告警，\n及早发现升级冲突。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6868":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#journal-node-指标","content":"| 指标名称              | 描述           |\n| ----------------- | ------------ |\n| journal_queue_len | Journal 队列长度 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6869":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-36","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#journal-node-指标","content":"| 指标名称                | 描述           |\n| ------------------- | ------------ |\n| journal_flush_count | Journal 刷新次数 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6870":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-37","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#journal-node-指标","content":"| 指标名称               | 描述           |\n| ------------------ | ------------ |\n| journal_flush_time | Journal 刷新时间 |","locale":"zh-cn","table":"table-2"},"6871":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring-38","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/monitoring#client-指标","content":"| 指标名称                    | 描述      |\n| ------------------