h-cn"},"6990":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-29","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#observability-与-operations","content":"Observability 与 Operations","locale":"zh-cn"},"6991":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-30","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","content":"Curvine 提供了直观易用的 Web 管理界面，用户可以通过浏览器实时监控集群状态、浏览文件系统、查看工作节点、跟踪加载与传输任务，并查看生效中的配置。Web 界面为集群运维和日常管理提供了可视化平台，大部分巡检工作不再需要命令行。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6992":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-31","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#启动控制台","content":"控制台是独立的 `curvine-web` 进程，不属于 Master 服务。Master 自身的 `web_port`（`9010`）只提供 `/metrics`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6993":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-32","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#启动控制台","content":"`curvine-web.sh` 只支持 `start`、`stop`、`restart`（没有 `status`）；查看进程请用 `ps`，或直接请求 `http://<host>:9000`。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6994":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-33","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#启动控制台","content":"相关配置：","locale":"zh-cn"},"6995":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-34","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#启动控制台","content":"监控页面背后的指标采集器与 Prometheus 集成由 `[web.observability]` 控制，详见配置参考。","locale":"zh-cn"},"6996":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui-35","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/Operations/webui#导航结构","content":"侧边栏的分组与控制台完全一致，面包屑也读取同一份定义。","