等参数","locale":"zh-cn"},"7244":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-14","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#服务端性能调优","content":"curvine配置调整如下示例:","locale":"zh-cn"},"7245":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-15","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#服务端性能调优","content":"内核参数调整示例（配置示例展示哪些参数会影响性能，仅供参考，以实际需求未准）：","locale":"zh-cn"},"7246":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-16","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#顺序读写场景","content":"顺序读写场景使用默认配置即可获得最佳性能。","locale":"zh-cn"},"7247":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-17","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#高并发读写场景","content":"当客户端需要同时处理大量文件IO时：","locale":"zh-cn"},"7248":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-18","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#高并发读写场景","content":"设置`read_chunk_num=1`和`write_chunk_num=1`减少内存占用","locale":"zh-cn"},"7249":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-19","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#高并发读写场景","content":"适用于并发文件数 > 1000的场景","locale":"zh-cn"},"7250":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-20","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#高并发读写场景","content":"单文件吞吐会下降，但是整体吞吐不变，内存使用会下降90%","locale":"zh-cn"},"7251":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-21","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#高并发读写场景","content":"配置示例：","locale":"zh-cn"},"7252":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-22","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt#大文件顺序读","content":"针对单个大文件(>100GB)的顺序读取：","locale":"zh-cn"},"7253":{"id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-Manuals/opt-23","page_id":"/zh-cn/docs/User-