when the config cannot be parsed or the state directory is unusable. It does not\nmount, and it does not check Master reachability. The Curvine CSI driver calls it\nduring node-side mount setup."],[5836,"`validate-config` 会加载配置，校验 `fuse.state_dir` 可写（不存在则创建），并对无法识别的 `[fuse]` 键给出告警——这类拼写错误本来会被静默忽略并沿用默认值。配置无法解析或 state 目录不可用时以非零码退出。它不会挂载，也不会检查 Master 是否可达。Curvine CSI 驱动在节点侧准备挂载时就是调用它。"],[2447,"`ValidateStorageClassParams` in `pkg/csi/validator.go` enforces:"],[3319,"`verdict` takes one of: `compatible`, `missing_info`, `blocked`,\n`protocol_mismatch`, `version_too_old`, `version_unknown`."],[6958,"`verdict` 取值：`compatible`、`missing_info`、`blocked`、`protocol_mismatch`、`version_too_old`、`version_unknown`。"],[6867,"`verdict` 标签取值：`compatible`、`missing_info`、`blocked`、\n`protocol_mismatch`、`version_too_old`、`version_unknown`。建议对\n`compat_worker_verdict` / `compat_client_verdict` 中非 `compatible` 的结论设置告警，\n以发现混合版本集群；对 `compat_enforce_rejected_total` 的增长设置告警，\n及早发现升级冲突。"],[2618,"`volumeClaimTemplates` entry named `data`"],[2412,"`volumeHandle = {cluster-id}@{fs-path}@{pv-name}`"],[6054,"`volumeHandle = {cluster-id}@{fs-path}@{pv-name}`"],[1048,"`worker_policy = \"local\"` prefers a local Worker for the first replica and assigns the remaining replicas through the weighted policy. `weighted` allocates according to `worker.weight`."],[4680,"`worker_policy = \"local\"` 会为第一个副本优先选择本地 Worker，其余副本通过 weighted 策略分配；`weighted` 按 `worker.weight` 分配。"],[1294,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` (default `false`) selects where multipart staging lives: `false` keeps upload parts on the gateway host's local filesystem, `true` uses Curvine DFS so several gateway instances can serve the same upload."],[2307,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` (in the `[worker]` section) selects distributed multipart storage: upload parts are written under `/.s3temp` in Curvine instead of `put_temp_dir`, so any gateway instance can complete an upload. Setting it also switches the binary to the distributed credential store."],[1295,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` is read by the gateway process, not by the Worker. You can set it in the gateway's own config file; it does not require restarting Workers."],[4927,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway` 由网关进程读取，Worker 本身不读取该字段。可以只在网关的配置文件里设置，无需重启 Worker。"],[4926,"`worker.enable_s3_gateway`（默认 `false`）决定分片上传的暂存位置：`false` 时存放在网关宿主机的本地文件系统，`true` 时使用 Curvine DFS，从而允许多个网关实例共同处理同一次上传。"],[1495,"`worker.s3Gateway.*` is live: with `enabled: true` the chart adds the\n`[s3_gateway]` block and `worker.enable_s3_gateway` to the ConfigMap, and creates\na Service on `worker.s3Gateway.listen` (default `0.0.0.0:9900`). The worker\ncontainer still only runs `/entrypoint.sh worker start`, so nothing starts the\ngateway binary for you — run `curvine-s3-gateway` as a sidecar or a separate\nDeployment until the chart ships one."],[5137,"`worker.s3Gateway.*` 是生效的：`enabled: true` 时 Chart 会把 `[s3_gateway]` 和 `worker.enable_s3_gateway` 写进 ConfigMap，并在 `worker.s3Gateway.listen`（默认 `0.0.0.0:9900`）上创建 Service。但 worker 容器仍然只运行 `/entrypoint.sh worker start`，不会帮你启动网关进程——在 Chart 提供之前，请用 sidecar 或单独的 Deployment 运行 `curvine-s3-gateway`。"],[2896,"`Write Type`: core read/write mode, `cache_mode` or `fs_mode`."],[6536,"`Write Type`：核心读写模式（`cache_mode` / `fs_mode`）"],[6031,"`副本数`：`3`"],[6032,"`容器内挂载路径`：`/usr/share/nginx/html`"],[2703,"| Action   | Meaning                                                                                                                                                  |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `delete` | Deletes file data and metadata after expiration. This is the most common expiration cleanup strategy, calculated from the file's last modification time. |"],[2704,"| Action | Meaning                                                                                                                                              